  "key_findings": [
    "The dual-stream model reaches the highest image-level AUC of 0.8944, above the texture-only ResNet50 stream (0.8728) and far above the vanilla Layer-24 ViT (0.6552).",
    "MLFA over layers {6, 12, 18} contributes roughly +10% AUC over deep-only Layer-24 features, confirming the semantic-gap hypothesis of Section 2.2.",
    "The anatomical prior filter adds roughly +4% AUC by removing non-anatomical background noise from the feature space.",
    "Fusing the two frozen streams adds a further +2.16% AUC over the strongest single stream, evidencing texture-context complementarity.",
    "The detector produces lesion heatmaps without any bounding-box supervision, giving soft localization at zero annotation cost."
  ]
